  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "圖形",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.server": "伺服器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding": "LOD 建構",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多執行緒",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.logging": "記錄",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "品質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD 區塊渲染距離半徑",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons 的渲染距離，以區塊為單位。\n\n注意：這是盡力而為的數值，\n實際渲染距離可能會高於或低於此數值，\n視你的其他圖形設定而定。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD 衰減距離",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "決定 LOD 品質每次下降之間的距離。\n\n設定越高，品質下降的間隔距離越長，\n但會增加記憶體與 GPU 用量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平解析度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD 能渲染的最高細節程度。\n\n§6最快：§r區塊\n§6最精緻：§r方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直品質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD 呈現懸崖突出處、洞穴、峭壁側面等地形的精細程度。\n\n選項越高，記憶體與 GPU 用量越大。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "以攝影機位置計算品質衰減",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "啟用後，DH 會在決定 LOD 品質衰減時\n嘗試使用攝影機位置。\n停用則使用玩家位置。\n\n啟用有助於自由視角（free-cam）模組正確渲染。\n停用有助於多攝影機模組（例如 Immersive Portals 或攝影機類模組）正確渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "放大時提高品質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "啟用後，攝影機放大時 LOD 品質會提高，\n例如使用望遠鏡或縮放模組時。\n\n只有攝影機視野內可見的 LOD 會受影響。\n\n放大時，LOD 會載入成與你靠近它們時\n相同的細節程度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "最大縮放品質提升",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "放大時 LOD 品質最多可提升幾個細節層級。\n數值越高，放大倍率越大時能渲染越銳利的地形，\n但放大期間會增加記憶體與 GPU 用量。\n\n原版望遠鏡需要 4 個細節層級才能達到最佳品質。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平縮放",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "LOD 品質下降的速度。\n\n數值越大，遠方地形看起來越好，\n但會增加記憶體與 GPU 用量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD 著色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "決定 LOD 的著色方式。\n可用來改善與光影的相容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草地側面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "草方塊 LOD 的側面與底部該如何渲染？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "淡出鄰近的 DH LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "啟用後，LOD 會在你靠近時逐漸淡出。\n停用則 LOD 會在距離攝影機一定距離處突然截斷。\n此設定會受到原版過度繪製防護設定的影響。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "原版淡化模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "原版 Minecraft 該如何淡化並銜接到 Distant Horizons 的 LOD？\n\nNONE：最快，DH 與 MC 的渲染之間會有明顯的邊界。\nSINGLE_PASS：在 MC 的透明通道之後淡化，水下的不透明方塊不會被淡化。\nDOUBLE_PASS：最慢，在 MC 的不透明與透明通道之後都會淡化，過渡最為平滑。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane": "在遠裁切面前淡出",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane.@tooltip": "DH 是否應在到達遠裁切面前淡出？\n這有助於避免 DH 的雲在遠處被截斷。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 顏色的明亮程度。\n\n0 = 黑色 \n1 = 正常 \n2 = 接近白色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier": "飽和度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 顏色的飽和程度。\n\n0 = 黑白 \n1 = 正常 \n2 = 鮮豔",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生態域混合",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "與原版的生態域混合設定相同，但套用於 LOD 區域。\n\n注意：任何大於「0」的值都會拖慢 LOD 載入時間。\n\n「0」等同於原版生態域混合的「1x1」，\n「1」等同於原版生態域混合的「3x3」，\n「2」等同於原版生態域混合的「5x5」…… \n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao": "啟用環境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao.@tooltip": "環境光遮蔽能為方塊的光照增添層次感。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing": "啟用抗鋸齒",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing.@tooltip": "啟用抗鋸齒可使邊緣更平滑，並減少移動時的閃爍。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering": "通用物件渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering": "啟用通用渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering.@tooltip": "啟用後，DH 會渲染非地形的物件，\n例如燈塔光束與雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering": "啟用燈塔渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight": "燈塔渲染高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight.@tooltip": "設定燈塔最高渲染到的高度。需要重新載入世界才會生效。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "加寬遠處燈塔",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "啟用後，LOD 燈塔光束在極遠距離會被渲染得更寬，\n使其更容易看見。\n停用則所有 LOD 燈塔光束一律只有 1 格方塊寬。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "啟用後，會渲染 LOD 燈塔光束。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "啟用雲渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "啟用後，會渲染 LOD 雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "啟用雲的維度 CSV 清單",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的維度資源位置清單，DH 的雲將在這些維度中渲染。\n\n範例：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n變更後需要重新載入世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "啟用多層雲",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "停用 = DH 會像原版 Minecraft 一樣渲染單層雲。\n啟用 = DH 會在不同高度渲染 3 層雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "啟用 Distant Horizons 霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "決定是否在 DH 的 LOD 上繪製霧。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "霧顏色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD 上霧的顏色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "啟用原版霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6啟用：§rMinecraft 正常渲染霧。\n§6停用：§r關閉原版區塊上的 Minecraft 霧。\n\n可能會與其他修改霧的模組產生問題。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "進階霧選項",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "霧起點",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "霧該從哪裡開始？\n\n  '0.0'：霧從玩家位置開始。\n  '1.0'：霧起點的圓剛好內接於 LOD 渲染距離的正方形。\n'1.414'：LOD 渲染距離的正方形剛好內接於霧起點的圓。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "霧終點",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "霧該在哪裡結束？\n\n  '0.0'：霧在玩家位置結束。\n  '1.0'：霧終點的圓剛好內接於 LOD 渲染距離的正方形。\n'1.414'：LOD 渲染距離的正方形剛好內接於霧終點的圓。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "霧最小值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "霧的最小濃度是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全沒有霧。\n  '1.0'：完全是霧的顏色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "霧最大值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "霧的最大濃度是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全沒有霧。\n  '1.0'：完全是霧的顏色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "霧衰減方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "霧的濃度該如何計算？\n\nLINEAR：依距離線性計算（會忽略「密度」）\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density)) \nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2)) \n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity": "霧密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "霧的密度是多少？ ",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "高度霧選項",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度霧混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "決定高度如何影響霧。\n不確定時，請從 SPHERICAL、ADDITION 或 MAX 開始嘗試。\n\nSPHERICAL：依攝影機距離計算霧。\nCYLINDRICAL：忽略高度，依水平距離計算霧。\nMAX: max(heightFog, farFog) \nADDITION: heightFog + farFog \nMULTIPLY: heightFog * farFog \nINVERSE_MULTIPLY: 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog) \nLIMITED_ADDITION: farFog + max(farFog, heightFog) \nMULTIPLY_ADDITION: farFog + farFog * heightFog \nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION: farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog) \nAVERAGE: farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "高度霧方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "高度霧該位於哪裡？\n\nABOVE_CAMERA：高度霧從攝影機向上延伸至天空\nBELOW_CAMERA：高度霧從攝影機向下延伸至虛空\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：高度霧從攝影機同時向上延伸至天空、向下延伸至虛空\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：高度霧從設定高度向上延伸至天空\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：高度霧從設定高度向下延伸至虛空\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：高度霧從設定高度同時向上延伸至天空、向下延伸至虛空\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度霧基準高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "如果高度霧是以某個設定高度為中心計算，那麼該高度位置是多少？ ",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度霧起點",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "高度霧的起點應偏移多遠？\n\n  '0.0'：霧起點沒有偏移。\n  '1.0'：霧起點偏移整個世界的高度。（包含深度）\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度霧終點",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "高度霧的終點應偏移多遠？\n\n  '0.0'：霧終點沒有偏移。\n  '1.0'：霧終點偏移整個世界的高度。（包含深度）\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "高度霧最小值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "霧的最小濃度是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全沒有霧。\n  '1.0'：完全是霧的顏色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "高度霧最大值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "霧的最大濃度是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全沒有霧。\n  '1.0'：完全是霧的顏色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度霧衰減方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "高度霧的濃度該如何計算？\n\nLINEAR：依高度線性計算（會忽略「密度」）\nEXPONENTIAL: 1/(e^(height*density)) \nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED: 1/(e^((height*density)^2)) \n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度霧密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "高度霧的密度是多少？ ",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD 紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "啟用 LOD 紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "啟用後，鄰近與放大時的 LOD 會以其方塊的\n實際紋理與輪廓渲染，而不是單一的純色。\n\n僅適用於紋理確實看得見的高細節 LOD，\n遠處的 LOD 一律使用純色。\n使用光影包時無效，因為光影包\n會以自己的著色程式渲染 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "最大紋理細節層級",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "可使用方塊紋理渲染的最高細節層級數值。\n在較高的細節層級，每個 LOD 會涵蓋多個方塊，\n使紋理小於一個像素而看不見。\n\n數值越大，越遠的 LOD 也會貼上紋理，\n但會增加記憶體用量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不渲染紋理的方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，\n DH 不會在這些方塊上渲染紋理。\n 部分相符／不完整的資源位置也會被視為相符。\n\n 範例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n 變更後需要重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用側面紋理的方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，\n DH 會以底部紋理來渲染這些方塊的側面。 \n部分相符／不完整的資源位置也會被視為相符。 \n\n範例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\" \n\n變更後需要重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用側面紋理的方塊標籤",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的標籤名稱清單，\n DH 會以底部紋理來渲染這些標籤方塊的側面。 \n\n範例：\"grass_blocks,nylium\" \n\n變更後需要重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "一律光柵化紋理的方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，\nDH 會對這些方塊使用光柵化來判定\n各面的紋理。\n\n可用來修正模組／方塊的問題，\n例如某個面只使用了模型方塊紋理的一部分。 \n\n範例：\"minecraft:beacon\" \n\n變更後需要重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "雜訊紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "啟用雜訊紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "啟用後，會在 LOD 上套用雜訊紋理以模擬紋理效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "雜訊階數",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "決定要在 LOD 上套用幾階雜訊。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "雜訊強度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "決定雜訊紋理的強烈程度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "雜訊衰減距離",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "決定雜訊紋理渲染到多遠後會淡出。（以方塊為單位）\n設為 0 可停用雜訊淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "過度繪製防護",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "決定 Distant Horizons 從距離攝影機多遠處開始渲染。\n以原版渲染距離的百分比表示。\n-1 = 自動，過度繪製會依原版渲染距離而改變。\n\n數值越高，越能避免 LOD 在較遠距離被渲染在原版方塊後方，\n但可能使 LOD 出現破洞。\n破洞最常出現在飛行穿越未載入的地形時。\n\n提高原版渲染距離可增進此設定的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "快速移動時減少過度繪製",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "設為啟用時，飛行／快速移動時\n過度繪製防護半徑會更靠近攝影機。\n\n這有助於減少 Minecraft 載入或\n生成區塊的速度跟不上 DH 的問題。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "啟用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "啟用後會剔除洞穴 \n\n補充資訊：目前在沒有天花板的維度中，\n會剔除洞穴剔除高度以下\n天空光等級為 0 的所有面。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "洞穴剔除要從哪個 Y 值開始？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "啟用燈塔距離剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "啟用後，攝影機附近的燈塔不會被繪製，以避免原版過度繪製。\n停用則會渲染所有燈塔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "停用視錐剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "停用時，玩家攝影機範圍外的 LOD\n不會被繪製，可提升 GPU 效能。\n\n啟用時，所有 LOD 都會被繪製，甚至包括\n玩家攝影機後方的，會降低 GPU 效能。\n\n如果你看到視野邊角的 LOD 消失，請停用此選項。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "停用陰影通道視錐剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "與另一個視錐剔除選項相同，但僅在\n有光影模組透過 DH API 運作\n且正在渲染陰影通道時使用。\n\n如果陰影渲染不正確，請停用此選項。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略方塊 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，DH 不會渲染這些方塊。\n空氣一律包含在此清單中。\n\n注意：\n如果你看到縫隙或破洞，可能需要將\nworldCompression 改為 [MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS] 並重新生成 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "忽略洞穴方塊 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，若這些方塊位於天空光為 0 的\n地底區域，則不應被渲染。\n空氣一律包含在此清單中。\n\n預設為空清單，因為大多數洞穴方塊本身就會被自動忽略，原因是：\n透明、非實心或為液體，但若有需要，可在此加入新的方塊。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水下表層替換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，若這些方塊在水面上可見，\n就會被替換為水。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面替換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的方塊資源位置清單，這些方塊位於水面上方時\n會被移除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "要忽略的方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "決定哪些方塊應被渲染為 LOD。 \n\n§NONE:§r LOD 包含所有方塊\n§NON_COLLIDING:§r LOD 只渲染實心方塊（高草叢、火把等會被忽略）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "以被避開的方塊染色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：會讓雪、地毯與活板門看起來非常糟糕§r\n被避開的方塊下方的方塊是否應染上被避開方塊的顏色？\n§6啟用：§r草地上的紅花會把下方的草染成紅色\n§6停用：§r被略過的方塊不會改變其下方表面的顏色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "覆寫原版設定",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "啟用後，DH 設定期間會自動變更部分原版圖形設定，\n以提供更好的體驗。\n\n例如停用原版的雲（會渲染在 DH 的 LOD 之上），\n以及區塊淡入效果（DH 已會淡化 MC 區塊）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental": "實驗性",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "數值 1 等同於現實中地球的曲率。\n可接受的最小值為 50，最大值為 5000。\n介於 1 到 49 之間的值都會被進位為 50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略維度 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "以逗號分隔的維度資源位置清單，DH 不會在這些維度中渲染。範例：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\" \n\nMinecraft 1.12.2 及更舊版本：\n開啟 F3 畫面，複製以黃色顯示的 dimension_name:ID。範例：\"overworld:0\" \n\n注意：\n停用 DH 渲染時，部分 DH 設定會被停用及／或變更，\n以改善視覺效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "變更後需要重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater": "自動更新程式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableAutoUpdater": "啟用自動更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates": "啟用靜默更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates.@tooltip": "有新版本時自動更新模組",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch": "更新分支",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch.@tooltip": "從哪裡下載最新版本。\n\n自動：依目前的 jar 檔下載穩定版或每夜建置版。\n穩定版：來自 Modrinth 的穩定建置。\n每夜版：來自 Gitlab 的每夜建置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人遊戲",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "伺服器資料夾模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "決定本機多人遊戲資料的資料夾格式。\n\n§6僅名稱：§r\n使用伺服器列表中的名稱。例：\"Minecraft Server\"\n§6僅 IP：§r\n\"192.168.1.40\"\n§6名稱與 IP：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40\"\n§6名稱、IP、連接埠：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"\n§6名稱、IP、連接埠、MC 版本：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1\"\n\n§c§l注意：§r連線至多人遊戲伺服器時變更此設定可能造成異常。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging": "除錯",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.rendererMode": "渲染器模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugRenderingColors": "除錯渲染顏色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode": "僅渲染 LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode.@tooltip": "啟用後會停用（大部分的）原版 Minecraft 渲染。\n\n注意：此模式開啟時，請勿回報任何問題！\n此設定僅供娛樂與除錯用途。\n不保證與其他模組相容。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe": "渲染線框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe.@tooltip": "啟用後，LOD 會以線框方式渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings": "啟用除錯快捷鍵",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings.@tooltip": "啟用後，可使用數個按鍵切換除錯狀態。\nF6 - 啟用／停用 LOD 渲染 \nF7 - 啟用／停用僅渲染 LOD \nF8 - 循環切換不同的除錯渲染模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld": "啟用白色世界",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld.@tooltip": "啟用後，不會傳遞頂點顏色。\n適用於除錯光影。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors": "顯示重疊四邊形錯誤",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors.@tooltip": "啟用後，重疊的四邊形會被渲染為亮紅色，方便辨識。\n停用則四邊形會正常渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection": "記錄緩衝區垃圾回收",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection.@tooltip": "啟用後，會記錄 OpenGL 緩衝區的垃圾回收，\n其中也包含存活緩衝區的數量。 ",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues": "允許不安全的介面數值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues.@tooltip": "啟用後，只會進行非常有限的設定輸入驗證。\n\n警告：啟用此選項可能導致不穩定或當機，風險自負。\n注意：此選項不會在不同遊戲階段間保存。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe": "除錯線框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering": "啟用除錯線框渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering.@tooltip": "啟用後，會繪製各種用於除錯內部功能的線框。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showWorldGenQueue": "顯示世界生成佇列",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showNetworkSyncOnLoadQueue": "顯示載入時網路同步佇列",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showRenderSectionStatus": "顯示渲染區段狀態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showRenderSectionToggling": "顯示渲染區段切換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showQuadTreeRenderStatus": "顯示四元樹渲染狀態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showFullDataUpdateStatus": "顯示完整資料更新狀態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl": "OpenGL",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.overrideVanillaGLLogger": "覆寫原版 GL 記錄器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.overrideVanillaGLLogger.@tooltip": "決定 OpenGL 錯誤的處理方式。\n需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能變更。\n會捕捉其他模組丟出的 OpenGL 錯誤。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.onlyLogGlErrorsOnce": "每個 GL 錯誤只記錄一次",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.onlyLogGlErrorsOnce.@tooltip": "啟用後，每個 OpenGL 錯誤只會被記錄一次。 \n啟用此選項可能導致部分錯誤記錄被遺漏。 \n若 overrideVanillaGLLogger 設為停用，則此選項無作用。 \n\n一般情況下可維持啟用，以避免記錄被洗版。 \n不過，若開發者需要你的記錄來除錯 GL 問題，請將此選項設為停用。 \n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.glErrorHandlingMode": "OpenGL 錯誤處理模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.glErrorHandlingMode.@tooltip": "決定 OpenGL 錯誤的處理方式。 \n 需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能套用。 \n可能會誤捕捉其他模組丟出的 OpenGL 錯誤。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging": "渲染欄位建構器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugEnable": "啟用欄位建構器限制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugDetailLevel": "欄位建構器限制 - 細節層級",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugXPos": "欄位建構器限制 - X 位置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugZPos": "欄位建構器限制 - Z 位置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugXRow": "欄位建構器限制 - X 列",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugZRow": "欄位建構器限制 - Z 列",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging.columnBuilderDebugColumnIndex": "欄位建構器限制 - 欄位索引",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging": "位置搜尋器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderEnable": "啟用位置搜尋器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderDetailLevel": "絕對細節層級",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderXPos": "X 位置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderZPos": "Z 位置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderMinBlockY": "最小方塊 Y",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderMaxBlockY": "最大方塊 Y",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.positionFinderDebugging.positionFinderMarginPercent": "邊距 %",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.f3Screen": "F3 畫面",
